"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-12px)\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 w-44 truncate\">orchestrator.synthesize</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400 w-16\">\u2713 ok</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-sky-400 w-16 text-right\">571<!-- --> ms</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-500 flex-1\">Orchestrator</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-12px)\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 w-44 truncate\">memory.persist_results</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400 w-16\">\u2713 ok</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-sky-400 w-16 text-right\">88<!-- --> ms</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-500 flex-1\">System</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent from-violet-500/15 to-transparent origin-left my-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><section class=\"relative h-[280vh]\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 h-screen flex items-center overflow-hidden px-6 lg:px-20\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl backdrop-blur border border-indigo-500/30 bg-transparent p-4\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400\"></span><span class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-indigo-400\">Orchestrator</span></div><p class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Plans the query, coordinates the team, synthesizes the final answer.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl backdrop-blur border border-sky-500/30 bg-transparent p-4\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400\"></span><span class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-sky-400\">Researcher</span></div><p class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Runs a tool-use loop \u2014 search + fetch \u2014 until sufficient evidence is gathered.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl backdrop-blur border border-violet-500/30 bg-transparent p-4\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400\"></span><span class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-violet-400\">Compliance Judge</span></div><p class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Reviews the Researcher&#x27;s output for accuracy and compliance before it is persisted.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) scale(0.95)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-violet-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">Multi-Agent Team</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-mono font-black text-zinc-100 leading-tight\">Three agents.<br/>One mission.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">The Orchestrator delegates. The Researcher loops through tools until it has enough evidence. The Compliance Judge reviews everything before a single byte hits Convex.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 6a9 9 0 0 0-9 9V3\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400\">Powered by Anthropic claude-sonnet-4-6</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent from-emerald-500/15 to-transparent origin-left my-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><section class=\"px-6 lg:px-20 py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">Capabilities</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-mono font-black text-zinc-100\">Enterprise-ready, out of the box.</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur h-full p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-5 h-5 text-rose-400 mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2\">PII Masking</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Regex-based server-side scrub of emails, phones, SSNs, and card numbers before spans reach the wire.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur h-full p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain w-5 h-5 text-violet-400 mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 18V5\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5\"></path><path d=\"M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77\"></path><path d=\"M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.483A4 4 0 1 1 12 18a4 4 0 1 1-7.967-.517\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-2-7.464\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125a4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2\">Active Learning</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Pattern detectors surface latency spikes, token bloat, error clusters, and tool-call loops across every run.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur h-full p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database w-5 h-5 text-sky-400 mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2\">Memory Timeline</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Convex persists every run. Diff badges highlight what changed since the last scan so nothing goes unnoticed.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur h-full p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2\">OTLP Export</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Ship spans to any OpenTelemetry-compatible collector \u2014 Jaeger, Grafana Tempo, Honeycomb \u2014 with one env var.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent from-sky-500/10 to-transparent origin-left my-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><section class=\"px-6 lg:px-20 py-32 relative\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 0%, rgba(129,140,248,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%)\"></div><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">How It Works</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-mono font-black text-zinc-100\">Three steps from query to insight.</h2></div><div class=\"relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(16.67%+16px)] right-[calc(16.67%+16px)] h-px pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(129,140,248,0.25), rgba(14,165,233,0.25), rgba(139,92,246,0.25))\"></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl backdrop-blur relative h-full border border-indigo-500/20 bg-transparent p-6\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><span class=\"text-[32px] font-mono font-black leading-none text-indigo-400 opacity-30 mb-4 block\">01</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-3\">Submit a Query</h3><p class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Type any prompt into the Query Composer. The Orchestrator receives it and plans which tools and agents to activate.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl backdrop-blur relative h-full border border-sky-500/20 bg-transparent p-6\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><span class=\"text-[32px] font-mono font-black leading-none text-sky-400 opacity-30 mb-4 block\">02</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-sky-400 mb-3\">Agents Run &amp; Emit Spans</h3><p class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">Each agent step emits a real OpenTelemetry span tagged with gen_ai.system, model, token counts, latency, and PII flags. Watch the timeline update live.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl backdrop-blur relative h-full border border-violet-500/20 bg-transparent p-6\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl transition-[background] duration-75\"></div><span class=\"text-[32px] font-mono font-black leading-none text-violet-400 opacity-30 mb-4 block\">03</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-violet-400 mb-3\">Persist &amp; Learn</h3><p class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">The Compliance Judge validates the run, then everything is saved to Convex. Pattern detectors surface latency drift, error clusters, and PII recurrence across all historical runs.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 lg:px-20 py-32 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(129,140,248,0.05) 0%, transparent 70%)\"></div><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-8 h-8 text-indigo-400 mx-auto mb-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-mono font-black text-zinc-100 leading-tight mb-4\">Ready to trace<br/>your agents?</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-mono text-zinc-300 mb-10\">Open the live dashboard \u2014 no setup required, mock stream starts instantly.</p><button class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #818cf8);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(129,140,248,0.3), 0 8px 32px rgba(99,102,241,0.3)\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/20\" style=\"transform:translateX(-100%)\"></span><span class=\"relative text-white font-semibold\">Launch Dashboard</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" st